      ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             3.12 打开塑料布，将咖啡果铺中等厚度，晾晒10天，每天翻动3次；\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             3.22 咖啡果放入白色塑料筐里，放置在低温房间里（17摄氏度）24小时\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             3.23 咖啡果转到晒床，铺薄晾晒8天，每天翻动2次；\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             3.31 咖啡果转到烘干机（静态的烘干箱）内，35摄氏度，机械干燥4天；\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             4.4 咖啡果装入白色塑料筐内在仓库里静置\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这是一个非常传统的日晒批次，\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           淡淡的花香还有绿茶感，没什么发酵感，果酸也很柔和，舒服易饮～\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n             特征关键词：黄色柑橘+绿茶感+柔和果酸\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于Kotowa与Duncan\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Kotowa在当地Ngobe语言里是山脉的意思，而Duncan是来自于一个加拿大人Alexander Duncan MacIntyre的名字。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SUmFynsJ8mZibzFwhDyicticjtYqkuKWbfATWmnfZljXc5MQ2X2SwCOUUEgzQEDXT1oMJ5HT0MSP15g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Alexander在加拿大的一份报纸上看到在巴拿马，有一个非常原始的山区叫做波奎特，连绵的山峰与火山，这份对未知的好奇心让他第一次踏上了这块土地，当地原始的生态与热情的人们让他彻彻底底的爱上了这块地方。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           1918年，Alex在这块土地上定居下来，开始进行农作开荒；\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           四代人的繁衍生息，现如今，Duncan家族建立的Kotowa咖啡旗下有7个咖啡庄园，分别是\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SUmFynsJ8mZibzFwhDyicticjcPEbFPhqFASoy3oYNST42ZfOBc33u5e3rmn2WTgzM270stMIsWCffw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 348px;height: 327px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7RRLlSV1j42roFmP1RwrDE5E2E86nMX41MibYlq6EQCUqMYIoRy8uZvOINogFqNqMKBlmuM9PGzOiaA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           Richard设计的农场，品种，处理方式的颜色标签，用于在生产中来管理不同农场品种处理批次\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span>\n            Kotowa获得的奖项\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjScL1SnDicENakhWdicf6Wko02KsaAtedcvWPrRaAngiayyBm97atWDo0Wwibs995ib01vscvUX2j7Uw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RRLlSV1j42roFmP1RwrDE5JYibIfwSibJFPDztpu0nzLS38VbfTmzSsQzNiaYHBG6rlXT1iajia7ZzRRg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RRLlSV1j42roFmP1RwrDE5WSiaI1H1Lv0CL0dqBoKgibGyyU6rtiaJpsicHyBqYehMjN6Iw31TmckVzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxgBe3IXVCXiaicJDaicT8QDWYbsqPcxr0e68OHB85icMvCwyHSicPpcH1GUBuNIfeqYeRur4kekSJRMg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxgBe3IXVCXiaicJDaicT8QDWYtCBkt60iaibNDzHGKv0H47RE5roOOWM57InXxVQqkibGiaZraF1LpIu4Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           文章部分内容来自\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           http://scap-panama.com/2017/03/18/cafe-kotowa/\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           https://templecoffee.com/farmers/panama-kotowa/\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           https://www.coffeehunter.com/the-coffee/kotowa-don-k/\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacS